CAMPAIGN_RANKING
3

OBJECTIVE_BEGIN
You must capture the palace citadel at F-9 to secure Novus.
OBJECTIVE_END

SPYINFO_BEGIN
1
You must traverse two teleporters to get to the palace citadel.  The first teleporter is on the throat of the body and the second is upon the brow of the face structures.
SPYINFO_END

DESCRIPTION_BEGIN
The native culture sculptured a likeness of the first humans to land in the landscape of Novus. We must free the native inhabitants from the Imperium and the colonists (rabble) who now occupy these monuments.
DESCRIPTION_END


